          "title1": "Wifi (extra GB for a fee)<br>locale guide",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted as one of the most reliable and proven frameworks and Mobirise has been equipped to develop websites using this framework.",
          "title2": "Restaurant, full board, excluding drinks.<br><div>pool</div><br><div><br></div>",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points is responsiveness and Mobirise makes effective use of this by generating highly responsive website for you.",
          "title3": "Spacious rooms <br>Comfortable bed\n<div>Ensuite bathroom</div>",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts compiled into its web font platform and Mobirise makes it easy for you to use them on your website easily and freely.",
          "title4": "with shower and toilet\n<div>Mosquito net</div><br><div>\n</div><div>locale guide</div>",
          "subtitle4": "<div>&nbsp;you the freedom to develop</div>",
          "caption4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop as many websites as you like given the fact that it is a desktop app.",
          "title5": "<div><span style=\"background-color: initial;\">Laundry service,</span><br></div><div>cleaning service, car service with driver</div><div>\n</div>",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "title6": "Lounge bar<br>Lake view\n<div>\n</div><div>Porch</div><div>\n</div><div>bar</div><div>Beach chairs\n</div><div>Parasols</div><div>boat service</div>",
          "subtitle6": "Don't limit yourself to just one platform",
          "caption6": "Publish your website to a local drive, FTP or host on Amazon S3, Google Drive, Github. Don't limit yourself to just one platform or service provider.",
