          "text": "<blockquote>Mwanza, often referred to as \"Rock City\" due to its unique rock formations, is a vibrant city on the southern shores of Lake Victoria in Tanzania. Here are the top 10 tourist activities to consider when visiting Mwanza:</blockquote>",
          "_tags": [
