          "title1": "1 Bismarck Rock",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "A prominent granite rock formation emerging from Lake Victoria, Bismarck Rock is Mwanza's iconic landmark. It's a popular spot for photography and offers scenic views of the lake. ",
          "title2": "2 Saanane Island National Park",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "As the first national park located within a city in Tanzania, Saanane Island offers wildlife viewing, picnic spots, and walking trails. Visitors can spot animals like zebras, impalas, and various bird species.",
          "title3": "3. Sukuma Museum",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "Dedicated to the Sukuma culture, Tanzania's largest ethnic group, this museum showcases traditional artifacts, dance performances, and insights into the Sukuma way of life..",
          "title4": "4. Rubondo Island National Park",
          "subtitle4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop",
          "caption4": "Located on Lake Victoria, this park is a haven for wildlife enthusiasts, offering sightings of chimpanzees, elephants, and diverse bird species. It's accessible via boat from Mwanza",
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "title6": "Host Anywhere",
          "subtitle6": "Don't limit yourself to just one platform",
          "caption6": "Publish your website to a local drive, FTP or host on Amazon S3, Google Drive, Github. Don't limit yourself to just one platform or service provider.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">MORE</a>",
